This product optionally builds and runs `crs/crs-sidecar`, which links against
and loads third-party components licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Neither is redistributed in this repository: the Go module is fetched at build
time and the ruleset is cloned separately (see crs/README.md). This notice is
carried because a built sidecar, or any distribution containing one, does
include them. The packaged Windows application is such a distribution: it
carries the built sidecar and the CRS request rules, and the licence of every
Go module compiled into the sidecar is under `_internal/licenses/crs-sidecar/`.

