One file here is not this project's own: `crs/rx.go` is adapted from
coraza-wasilibs and keeps its Apache-2.0 header. The sidecar's regular
expressions run on go-re2 (MIT), which carries RE2, wasi-libc and libc++
compiled to WebAssembly; their notices are in `crs/licenses/go-re2/`, and ship
beside go-re2's own licence in the packaged application.

